pubkeys: add the key that signs wireless-regdb's regulatory.bin

crda 4.15 knows the linville and sforshee keys; wireless-regdb's current
releases are signed with wens.key.pub.pem, so crda rejected the database
("Database signature verification failed"). The key is wireless-regdb's own
wens.key.pub.pem; crda compiles every pubkeys/*.pem in.

